      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANGEL ROCKS (3) finished second last start, beaten 3.5 metres at Hobart over 2090m. Talented and has plenty of upside. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. It doesn't get any easier but she is capable of a big performance. JILLSTIGER (2) finished fourth at Hobart two runs ago before a comparable effort at her latest appearance over 1680m at this track, beaten 10 metres. Has the benefit of a good draw. Meets a similar line up and she can figure in the finish. GLENVIEW LANIKAI (4) scored last start over 2200m at this track. Generally runs very well at this circuit so can play a big role again. WEONA EAGLE (6) should be forward enough to run a big race first-up from a spell following three trials.",
